\title{\sf{Bool}}

\p{The \Bool type is standard, with values \true and \false; no special capabilities are needed to use Boolean values themselves.}

\p{However, the eliminator for \Bool values is a built-in function \sf{if} with type

##{\sf{if} : \swpoly{\alpha; \delta}{\Exc{\sf{if}} \cup \delta}{\Bool \to \Delay{\delta}{\alpha} \to \Delay{\delta}{\alpha} \to \alpha}}

